        8,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norris_City%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The post office opened May 15, 1871, and the town was officially platted on August 17, 1871, just months later.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norris_City%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Norris City Historical Society keeps the town’s heritage alive and sells handmade quilts in its gift shop.",
